@startuml OID_UC2_AlreadyDecided
title Interaction diagram - UC2 recordDecision: proposal already accepted or rejected
hide footbox

' Section A, UC2 alternatives (Arno). This diagram agrees with CO4, the Section A CRC cards (#28) and GRASP (#32).
' Language of notes and messages: ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English.
' Scenario: CO4 controlled failure. The latest decision is "accepted" or "rejected". Q2 controls a new decision.
actor ":Proposal Editor" as PE
participant ":ProposalController" as PCtl
participant ":ProposalRepository" as Repo
participant ":Clock" as Clk
participant "p : Proposal" as P
participant "latest : ProposalDecision" as L

PE -> PCtl : recordDecision(proposal, outcome, conditions, note)
activate PCtl
PCtl -> Repo : p = find(proposal)
PCtl -> Clk : today = currentDate()
note right of PCtl
  editor = the signed-in Proposal Editor,
  taken from the session by the controller.
  It is not entered by the actor (UC2 SSD).
end note
PCtl -> P : result = recordDecision(outcome, editor, today, conditions, note)
activate P
P -> P : allowed = canRecordDecision()
activate P
P -> L : open = leavesProposalOpen()
L --> P : false
note right of L : The latest outcome is\n"accepted" or "rejected".
deactivate P
note over P : allowed = false
P --> PCtl : refused (already decided)
deactivate P
note over PCtl, P
  Proposal does not create a ProposalDecision.
  The controller does not save. The earlier decisions do not change (CO4).
end note
PCtl --> PE : The system does not record the decision.\nThe proposal is already accepted or rejected. Q2 controls a new decision.
deactivate PCtl
@enduml
